<!--Post: 5916--><!--Time: 1107456113-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5916"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t recall seeing a thread regarding the timeline and it seemed like a useful topic, so here goes.....  Apologies if I&#39;m duplicating.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5916-->
<!--Post: 5921--><!--Time: 1107457124-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5921"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->-1974 <BR>| - 1/15: Oteros mass murdered <BR>| <BR>| - 4/4: Brights attacked, Kathryn murdered <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1975 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1976 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1977 <BR>| <BR>| - 3/17: Vian murdered <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| - 12/8: Fox murdered <BR>-1978 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1979 <BR>| <BR>| - 4/28: Williams aborted attack <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1980 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1981 <BR>. <BR>. <BR>. <BR>{.... etc. etc. 1982 through 1985 ....} <BR>. <BR>. <BR>. <BR>-1986 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| - 9/16: Wegerle murdered <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1987 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1988 <BR>| - 1/88: Fager murder &#40;??&#41; <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1989 <BR>. <BR>. <BR>. <BR>{.... etc. etc. to present ....}<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5921-->
<!--Post: 5929--><!--Time: 1107458039-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5929"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Okay, so, point being.... many people fixate on that &#34;gap&#34; between Williams and Wegerle &#40;79 to 86&#41;, but.... <BR> <BR>If we are talking about a true serial killer in the classic sense, what about the gap between the Brights and Vian &#40;74 to 77&#41; and between Fox and Williams &#40;about 15 months, 77 to 79&#41;?!??!  Most serial killers, if I understand correctly, tend to kill within some kind of timing pattern, which they don&#39;t seem to be able to deviate far from. <BR> <BR>This timeline has no pattern, it has fits and starts, and therefore, IMHO, either it cannot possibly be complete, or BTK is not a serial killer! I think either 1&#41; BTK &#42;evolved&#42; into a serial killer: Otero and Bright had some classic motive &#40;&#34;the Coleman Connection&#34;?!?&#41; and after them, over the period of a couple years, BTK got a taste for murder; finally in March of &#39;77, he couldn&#39;t deny his urges any longer and started a serial killing career; or 2&#41; we have only a few small clusters of BTK&#39;s true serial killing activity on the timeline; or 3&#41; &#34;The BTK Stangler&#34; is a fiction cooked up to cover up some deeper plot &#40;think Howard&#39;s Zodiac / Bruce Davis theory&#41;. <BR> <BR>Or perhaps some combination of these. <BR> <BR>Brainstorming anyone? <BR> <BR>I&#39;d be particularly interested in your thoughts, Mike Kelleher.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5929-->
<!--Post: 5935--><!--Time: 1107458685-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5935"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->.... of course, another plausible explanation for the multiple gaps in the timeline is that BTK was &#34;unavailable&#34; during those time periods- prison or other institutionalization, living out of the area, etc.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5935-->
<!--Post: 5941--><!--Time: 1107460291-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5941"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Armchairpi...I have been having and have been pushing around similar thoughts.  BTK has obviously studied many different serial killers.  His behavior almost seems like he is trying to mimick what he thinks a real serial killer would do. Nice post. <BR> <BR>Doom <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5941-->
<!--Post: 5942--><!--Time: 1107460632-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5942"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 11:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I should add he may be mimicking for some deeper purpose other than sexual sadism.  He is obviously a sociopath but is he psychotic?  I am not so sure.   <BR> <BR>Doom<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5942-->
<!--Post: 5943--><!--Time: 1107461167-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5943"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Let&#39;s assume for a moment that BTK &#42;is&#42; a classical serial killer &#40;whether or not he was one during Otero/Bright, or evolved into one afterward&#41;.... <BR> <BR>I wonder &#40;Mike, thoughts?&#41; if it would be useful to use the &#34;official timeline&#34; as a template to fill in the <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/8.html?1107453458">possible victims</a>, and then rule out victims that don&#39;t seem to fit &#40;for instance because the &#34;possible&#34; murder is too close to &#34;official&#34; murders&#41;? <BR> <BR>Then, using this extrapolated &#34;semi-official&#34; timeline, perhaps we could expand our theories based on a better picture of BTK, his crimes, motives, psychology, etc..<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5943-->
<!--Post: 5953--><!--Time: 1107464496-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5953"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lubbock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lubbock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->By definition a psychotic has suffered a break with reality. He would not know right from wrong. A true psychotic experiences auditory and/or visual hallucinations and generally has delusions - persecution or grandure are most common. They are comonly fixated with themes of sex, obscinity and religion. It&#39;s been my experience that psychotics have little insight into their mental illness, and they could not fake normality. <BR> <BR>BTK is a sociopath. He knows what he is doing is wrong in the eyes of society and that if he were caught there would be consequences and reprocussions. He is cold, calculating, and absolutely egocentric. Lacking in any form of human empathy, he views his victims as having no more value than as objects for his amusement. This makes him infinitely more dangerous.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5953-->
<!--Post: 5954--><!--Time: 1107464529-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5954"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Based on the timeline and the thoughts presented after, it seems to me that BTK is not, in fact, a serial killer at all.  He is a COPY CAT killer.  Big difference!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5954-->
<!--Post: 5955--><!--Time: 1107464724-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5955"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lubbock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lubbock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dee: <BR> <BR>I still believe that BTK has committed more murders than he&#39;s taken credit for thus far. This would fill in the gaps.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5955-->
<!--Post: 5961--><!--Time: 1107467177-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5961"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Redhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Redhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 1:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Perhaps there are more &#34;near misses&#34; during this time than we know about.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5961-->
<!--Post: 5967--><!--Time: 1107470074-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5967"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 2:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t think &#34;near misses&#34; would satisfy him, if he&#39;s a serial killer.  I would expect a &#34;near miss&#34; to be followed up quite quickly with a &#34;successful&#34; murder.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5967-->
<!--Post: 6052--><!--Time: 1107497187-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6052"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I like your idea, Armchair.  A nice timeline with the possibles dropped in &#40;say, in a different color&#41; would be very interesting.  I would trust a highly suspicious repeating pattern more than I would trust the words of a sociopath. <BR> <BR>Remember, we&#39;ve been too trusting of BTK.  Perhaps WPD has, as well.  If he really screwed up and left a big fat handprint at a crimescene &#40;say the Fager murders&#41;, I would absolutely predict that BTK would lie and say he didn&#39;t do it &#40;but admired whoever did&#41;.  Ditto for other murders where he may have been using a new MO that he didn&#39;t trust yet.  I think there is every reason to think that BTK only takes credit where he sees a personal gain of some kind - or is jealous &#40;which could be very strange in an SK&#41;.  The fact that he didn&#39;t show up for so many years could mean that he had a good MO going in another city.  Perhaps something where the bodies weren&#39;t found, or were found in a state that could/would not be linked to him &#40;decomposed, drug OD, etc.&#41;. <BR> <BR>Yeah, we don&#39;t want to link him to Jimmy Hoffa or JFK, but it&#39;s worth taking a look at other murders on a timeline just in case something jumps out.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6052-->
<!--Post: 6054--><!--Time: 1107498142-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6054"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When you look at the possible victims list that involved women in the 70&#39;s, 80&#39;s and 90&#39;s they are pretty evenly spaced apart with approximately six from each of those three decades. <BR>If they were linked to BTK it would show that he never was incarcerated or at least in prison for any extended time but instead was killing all along. <BR>If you included the known victims it would show about a dozen victims in the 70&#39;s, seven in the 80&#39;s and six in the 90&#39;s.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6054-->
<!--Post: 6122--><!--Time: 1107539153-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6122"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lubbock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lubbock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 9:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Armchairpi: <BR> <BR>Have you done a timeline including all of the possible victims listed on this site? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
