<!--Post: 6139--><!--Time: 1107549689-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6139"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 12:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t mean to step on toes, but I have expanded the timeline and I stuck with Armchair&#39;s format.  Please let me know of anything I missed or reported incorrectly. <BR> <BR>-1974  <BR>| - 01/15: Joseph Otero and Julie Otero, strangled; Josephine and Joseph Jr., strangled <BR>|  <BR>| - 04/4:  Kathryn Bright stabbed to death, Kevin Bright shot &#40;survived&#41;  <BR>|  <BR>| - 11/12:  Sherry Baker found stabbed to death; hands tied <BR>|   <BR>-1975  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1976  <BR>|  <BR>| 11/26:  Denise Rathbun last seen – found 2 weeks later; died of drowning and exposure <BR>|  <BR>-1977  <BR>|  <BR>| - 03/17: Shirley Vian, bound and strangled &#40;children survived&#41; <BR>|  <BR>| - 12/08: Nancy Fox bound and strangled <BR>| <BR>-1978  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1979  <BR>|  <BR>| - 04/28: Anna Williams aborted attack  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1980  <BR>|  <BR>| 10/25:  Barbara Smith found beaten  <BR>|  <BR>-1981  <BR>|  <BR>| <BR>|{.... etc. etc. 1982 through 1984 ....}  <BR>| <BR>| <BR>- 1985 <BR>| <BR>| 04/27:  Marine Hedge abducted, found 8 days later strangled <BR>|  <BR>| 06/29:  Linda Casey; bound, beaten, s.a., stabbed <BR>|  <BR>-1986  <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>| 9/16: Vicki Wegerle, strangled <BR>|  <BR>|  <BR>-1987  <BR>|  <BR>| 06/06:  Hattie Smith bound, beaten, strangled, drowned in bathtub <BR>|  <BR>| 10/31:  Shannon Olson, found dead following day, hands bound <BR>|  <BR>| 01/31:  Phillip Fager, shot;  Kelli Fager, nude and strangled: Sherri Fager, strangled, bound <BR>|  <BR>-1988  <BR>| <BR>|   <BR>-1989  <BR>|  <BR>| 10/02:  Krista Martin beaten to death; blunt object to the back of the head <BR>|   <BR>- 1990 <BR>| <BR>-1991 <BR>| <BR>| 01/19:  Delores “Dee” Davis abducted, found 13 days later strangled, bound <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1992 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1993 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| 08/16:  Kristi Hatfield found dead; blow to the back of the head <BR>| <BR>-1994 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1995 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-1996 <BR>| <BR>| 09/12:  Cherie Fox shot to death <BR>| 10/30:  Avanthea Williams found dead <BR>| <BR>-1997 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>| 05/11:  Deanna Law found nude, strangled, s.a. <BR>| <BR>-1998 – 2001 <BR>| <BR>| <BR>-2002 <BR>| <BR>| 06/02:  Dorothy Slaughter beaten, died two weeks later <BR>| <BR>-2003 to present… <BR>| <BR>|  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
