<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6571"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchairpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchairpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 1:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.geocities.com/armchairpi/btk.htm">BTK Timeline</a> updated.  I believe it is current as of now- please <a href="mailto:armchairpi@yahoo.com">email</a> with thoughts, corrections, updates, additional unsolveds, etc..<!--/Text--></td></tr>
